From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ludovic Henry <git@ludovic.dev>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 23:45:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] platforms: add linux-riscv64

Upstream-Status: To upstream [not yet submitted; python-wheels does not open issues/PRs on third-party repos]

get_platform() raises "platform linux-riscv64 is not supported" on a
riscv64 host because the table has no entry for it. Add one with the
same shape as linux-aarch64 (arch "riscv64", so the maven classifier is
linuxriscv64); the wheel is retagged to manylinux by auditwheel, as the
aarch64 one is by rdev.

This patch applies to robotpy/hatch-robotpy, not to allwpilib.

Signed-off-by: Ludovic Henry <git@ludovic.dev>
---
 src/hatch_robotpy/platforms.py | 5 +++++
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+)

diff --git a/src/hatch_robotpy/platforms.py b/src/hatch_robotpy/platforms.py
index 54d6238..13478e6 100644
--- a/src/hatch_robotpy/platforms.py
+++ b/src/hatch_robotpy/platforms.py
@@ -62,6 +62,11 @@ _platforms = {
         os="linux",
         tag="linux_aarch64",
     ),
+    "linux-riscv64": WPILibMavenPlatform(
+        arch="riscv64",
+        os="linux",
+        tag="linux_riscv64",
+    ),
     "linux-systemcore": WPILibMavenPlatform(
         arch="systemcore",
         os="linux",
